        "text_free": "现在我们来关注这“纯根背根”的话题。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 2.852,
      "end": 8.006,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "安山区呢是认真落实的贯彻全方位夯实粮食安全的根基要求，",
      "score": 0.2689,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.3414,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2869,
        "sc_delta": 0.0545,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.449,
        "seg_cer": 0.077,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "安山区的是应真落实的，贯彻全方位夯实粮食安全的根基要求。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 8.175,
      "end": 13.577,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "加大了对于那些荒地的利用力度，也确保了耕地有增无减。",
      "score": 0.0381,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0004,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0004,
        "sc_delta": 0.0,
