        "seg_cer": 0.083,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "加大了对于那些房地产的利用力度，也确保了耕地有增无减。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 14.411,
      "end": 20.069,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "现在啊，安山区安山镇罗安村一百多亩的荒地上面积极种红棉，",
      "score": 0.1055,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0973,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0867,
        "sc_delta": 0.0106,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.231,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "现在啊，安山区安山镇罗安村一百多亩的房地上面，机器声轰鸣。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 20.347,
      "end": 25.458,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "拖拉机呢来回在原来的荒地高耕地为春播水稻做好准备。",
      "score": 0.0977,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1618,
        "sc_logprob": -0.168,
